# The area map's fog of war (tools/automap_test.py, docs/AUTOMAP.md): the user's quick save compass-spirit (map 0
# area 1) loads at VI 100 (ELTALE_QUICK_LOAD_AT; a save from before the fog: nothing explored). W walks, F2 quick
# saves (its explored cells go to automap/save_<key>.fog), D walks on (more is seen), M opens the full map (a
# picture: partly explored) and closes it, F4 quick loads (the explored cells as saved come back), M opens and closes
# the map again (a picture). With the cheat "Show the whole map" (fog-cheat) the same pictures show it all.
5 key_down Return
7 key_up Return
200 key_down W
260 key_up W
280 key_down F2
282 key_up F2
320 key_down D
420 key_up D
440 key_down M
442 key_up M
470 key_down M
472 key_up M
500 key_down F4
502 key_up F4
600 key_down M
602 key_up M
630 key_down M
632 key_up M
